### ============================================================
###  Kanban API — test.http
###  Requiere la extensión "REST Client" en VS Code
###  (humao.rest-client)
###
###  FLUJO DE USO:
###  1. Corre el servidor:  npm run dev
###  2. Ejecutá cada request en orden con "Send Request"
###  3. Copiá el _id de la respuesta y pegalo en la variable
###     correspondiente (@boardId, @columnId, @ticketId)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@boardId = PEGAR_ID_AQUI
@columnId = PEGAR_ID_AQUI
@columnId2 = PEGAR_ID_AQUI
@ticketId = PEGAR_ID_AQUI


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  HEALTH CHECK
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### [OK] Verificar que el servidor responde
GET {{baseUrl}}/health


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  FASE 1 — BOARDS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### [201] Crear tablero válido → copiar _id a @boardId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Proyecto Web",
  "description": "Sprint 1 — Kanban"
}

###

### [400] Crear tablero sin título → ValidationError
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "falta el título"
}

###

### [200] Obtener tablero con columnas populadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}

###

### [400] Obtener tablero con ID mal formado (< 24 hex)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/123abc

###

### [404] Obtener tablero con ID válido pero inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/000000000000000000000000


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  FASE 2 — COLUMNS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### [201] Crear columna "Por hacer" → copiar _id a @columnId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Por hacer"
}

###

### [201] Crear columna "En progreso" → copiar _id a @columnId2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "En progreso"
}

###

### [400] Crear columna sin título
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### [404] Crear columna en tablero inexistente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/000000000000000000000000/columns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Columna huérfana"
}

###

### [200] Obtener tablero → debe mostrar las columnas populadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  FASE 3 — TICKETS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### [201] Crear ticket → copiar _id a @ticketId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Diseñar pantalla de login",
  "description": "Wireframe aprobado en Figma"
}

###

### [201] Crear segundo ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Configurar pipeline CI/CD"
}

###

### [400] Crear ticket sin título
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "descripción sin título"
}

###

### [404] Crear ticket en columna inexistente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/000000000000000000000000/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ticket huérfano"
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  FASE 4 — PATCH TICKET (actualizar / mover)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### [200] Actualizar título y descripción
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Diseñar pantalla de login — revisado",
  "description": "Incluir modo oscuro"
}

###

### [200] Mover ticket a columna2 (targetColumnId → campo "column")
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "column": "{{columnId2}}"
}

###

### [200] Idempotencia: repetir el mismo PATCH → mismo resultado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "column": "{{columnId2}}"
}

###

### [400] PATCH sin campos válidos
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### [400] Mover ticket a columna de OTRO tablero
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "column": "000000000000000000000001"
}

###

### [400] Ticket ID mal formado
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}/tickets/malformado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "irrelevante"
}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────
#  FASE 5 — DELETE COLUMN (cascada de tickets)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### [204] Eliminar columna → sus tickets desaparecen en cascada
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}

###

### [404] Eliminar columna ya borrada (o inexistente)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/{{columnId}}

###

### [400] Eliminar columna con ID inválido
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/columns/xyz

###

### [404] Ruta inexistente → notFound middleware
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ruta-que-no-existe
